WEBVTT

00:09:29.762 --> 00:09:31.595
explanatory knowledge.

00:09:31.936 --> 00:09:34.944
For the first time in the universe,
for all we know.

00:09:35.413 --> 00:09:40.601
Explanatory knowledge
is the defining adaptation of our species.

00:09:41.149 --> 00:09:44.244
It differs from
the nonexplanatory knowledge

00:09:44.268 --> 00:09:46.506
in DNA, for instance,

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:48.306
by being universal.

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:52.354
That is to say,
whatever can be understood,

00:09:52.378 --> 00:09:55.044
can be understood
through explanatory knowledge.

00:09:55.068 --> 00:09:58.871
And more, any physical process

00:09:58.895 --> 00:10:01.776
can be controlled by such knowledge,